          "description": "<p>HeartBeat&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>Front-End main developer for website(s) of a new product for an&nbsp;important pharmaceutical brand. I oversaw end to end development,&nbsp;keeping close attention to semantic and accessibility, also oversaw SEO&nbsp;configuration, image optimizing, staging deployments, working close to&nbsp;PM with estimations, and many other tasks involved in the&nbsp;development cycle.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams like designers, QA,&nbsp;and PM to streamline processes, resulting in improved project delivery&nbsp;timelines and client satisfaction.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
